        "Section 9 says so, does not score the fresh test, and writes `_exploratory_<n>` files beside the earlier results; the artifact is "
        "overwritten (download `outputs/` first if you want to keep it).\n"
        "4. **Observe:** Section 9 prints `run_history` with both runs: validation AP, AP50 and the fine-tune seconds. Compare `num_fg` and "
